    "created_at": "2018-02-20T04:46:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-20T04:46:40Z",
    "body": "I'd also like to augment the secure context restriction with a top-level context restriction, i.e. Notification.requestPermission returns \"denied\" for non-secure and non-top-level contexts. Chrome shipped both of these restrictions in tandem.\r\n\r\nI can pull the top-level discussion out to a separate PR (and pull it out of the corresponding WPT at https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/pull/6596) if so desired, but it would be nice to combine them.",
