    "updated_at": "2018-02-20T12:42:14Z",
    "body": "If `Notification.permission` is to return \"denied\" by default, we also need to update the algorithm of its getter. Otherwise it would only return \"denied\" if you first invoked `requestPermission()`. (We should probably test that too.)\r\n\r\nDo you mean cross-origin non-top-level contexts or non-top-level contexts in general? We should probably do that as a separate change and couple it with Feature Policy somehow.",
